<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Password Reset</title>
</head>
<body>
<h2>Password Reset Notification</h2>

<p>Hello {{ name }},</p>

<p>Your password for the merchant account <strong>{{ merchantName }}</strong> has been reset by an administrator.</p>

<p><strong>New Temporary Password:</strong> {{ password }}</p>

<p>Please log in using this temporary password and change it immediately for security reasons.</p>

<p><strong>Login URL:</strong> https://portal.smartplanblueprint.com</p>

<p>If you did not request this password reset, please contact our support team immediately.</p>

<br>
<p>Best regards,<br>Smart Plan Blueprint Team</p>
</body>
</html>
